PATTERNS
Adjective
((AdjectiveOblC [>:>] [<obl>:а]) | AdjectiveOblV) [>:>] (DeclensionM | DeclensionF | DeclensionN | DeclensionHPL | DeclensionNPL)

(AdjectiveM | AdjectiveF | AdjectiveN | AdjectiveHPL | AdjectiveNPL)
AdjectiveOblM [<obl>>:>] DeclensionM
AdjectiveOblF [<obl>>:>]DeclensionF
AdjectiveOblN [<obl>>:>] DeclensionN
AdjectiveOblHPL [<obl>>:>] DeclensionHPL
AdjectiveOblNPL [<obl>>:>] DeclensionNPL

PATTERN DeclensionM
[<m>:щ] [>:>] [<erg>:ти]
OblMarker[m] [<gen>:]
OblMarker[m] [>:>] [<gen>:] [:б]
OblMarker[m] [>:>] (CaseMarker[-erg,-gen] | SpatialCase)

PATTERN DeclensionF
[<f>:т] [>:>] [<erg>:ти]
OblMarker[f] [>:>] (CaseMarker[-erg] | SpatialCase)

PATTERN DeclensionN
[<n>:т] [>:>] [<erg>:ти]
OblMarker[n] [>:>] (CaseMarker[-erg] | SpatialCase)

PATTERN DeclensionHPL
OblMarker[hpl] [<gen>:]
OblMarker[hpl] [>:>] [<gen>:] [:б]
OblMarker[hpl] [>:>] (CaseMarker[-gen] | SpatialCase)

PATTERN DeclensionNPL
OblMarker[npl] [>:>] (CaseMarker | SpatialCase)

PATTERN SpatialCase
LocMarker [<lat>:]
LocMarker[-cont] [>:>] DirMarker
LocMarker[cont] [>:>] DirMarker[-al,-trans]

LEXICON OblMarker
<m>:щу[m]
<f>:лълъи[f]
<n>:лълъи[n]
<h>><pl>:р>ду[hpl]
<n>><pl>:р>ди[npl]

LEXICON LocMarker
<sup>:ла
<cont>:чIу[cont]
<in>:о
<inter>:лIи
<apud>:ха
<ad>:хъи
<place>:алда

LEXICON DirMarker
<elat>:ру
<allat>:ху[al]
<translat>:руху[trans]
<translat>:риди[trans]
<translat>:руди[trans]
<translat>:рикьи[trans]

LEXICON CaseMarker
<erg>:ди[erg]
<gen>:лIи[gen]
<dat>:лъи
<aff>:ра
